    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN402 · Assessment 1/5</span>\n<h2>Class Participation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13185 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN402 · Đầu điểm 1/5</span>\n<h2>Class Participation</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13185 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Each student should make at least 1 individual presentation during the course in front of the class. Topics will be varied based on the topics in the textbook. In addition, students are required to do exercises and other activities</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=FIN402\">Exam Room — FIN402</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=FIN402\">Phòng thi — FIN402</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
